# Btop theme: Last Horizon (dark, dusty rose on near-black)
# Palette: bg #0c0b0c, fg #FAFCFB, accent #b59790, terracotta #c38b7b, teal #87a9b0,
#          lavender #a5a0b6, plum #6B5E73, pale blue #c4d8e2, muted #584e51, error #E6604F

